From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] advapi32: RegDisableReflectionKey checks its key

RegDisableReflectionKey was a FIXME stub that succeeded for any handle; it now checks the key like RegEnableReflectionKey and RegQueryReflectionKey (5009) and otherwise has no effect, reflection being off already (Windows 7 and later have no registry reflection either).
---
--- a/dlls/advapi32/registry.c
+++ b/dlls/advapi32/registry.c
@@ -760,6 +760,11 @@
  */
 LONG WINAPI RegDisableReflectionKey(HKEY base)
 {
-    FIXME("%p: stub\n", base);
+    TRACE("%p\n", base);
+    /* (wine-sg 8284) as RegEnableReflectionKey: the key is checked; reflection is already off (Wine keeps no
+     * reflection list, as Windows 7 and later), so nothing else changes */
+#ifdef SG_MUTANT_DISABLE_REFLECTION_NO_CHECK
     return ERROR_SUCCESS;
+#endif
+    return reflection_check_key( base );
 }
